    "description": "Akumin provides outpatient diagnostic imaging, radiation oncology, and related clinical support services across the United States. Its customers include hospitals, health systems, physician groups, and patients that outsource or partner for imaging center operations, mobile imaging, and oncology services. The business combines owned and managed clinical sites with mobile and relocatable assets, giving it a mixed operating model with both asset-heavy and service-based characteristics. Public materials describe a national network of more than 180 centers and one of the largest mobile imaging fleets in the country, with partnerships spanning hundreds of healthcare organizations. Stonepeak agreed to acquire Akumin in 2023 and completed a deleveraging transaction that made the company a wholly owned private business in February 2024.",
